			<i><span class="en">
				Theopomp.Com.
				8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				271
			</span></i>; of the <i>deceptive appearance</i> of certain unripe
			figs, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				731
			</span></i>; with neut. Adj., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτ᾽ ἄρ᾽ ἐφενάκιζες σύ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					90
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.66
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				2
			</span></i>: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. ἀτηρῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Mus.</u>
					p.104K.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> trans., <i>cheat, trick,</i>
